 <td colspan=\"3\"></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"2\">单调性</td>\n    <td colspan=\"3\">x₁ &lt; x₂，f(x₁) &lt; f(x₂) ⟹ f(x) 是增函数，$\\frac{f(x_1)-f(x_2)}{x_1-x_2}$ &gt; 0 ⟹ f(x) 是增函数</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"3\">x₁ &lt; x₂，f(x₁) &gt; f(x₂) ⟹ f(x) 是减函数，$\\frac{f(x_1)-f(x_2)}{x_1-x_2}$ &lt; 0 ⟹ f(x) 是减函数</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\">奇偶性</td>\n    <td colspan=\"3\">复合函数y=f(g(x)) 同增异减</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"3\">f(-x) = f(x)  f(x) 是偶函数⟹图像关于y轴对称，对称轴x=0</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"3\">f(-x) = -f(x) ⟹ f(x) 是奇函数⟹图像关于原点对称，对称中心($\\frac{a+b}{2}$, 0)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>零点</td>\n    <td colspan=\"3\">\n      <div class=\"flowchart\">\n        <div class=\"bubble\">函数y=f(x)有零点</div>\n        <span class=\"arrow\">⟷</span>\n        <div class=\"bubble\">函数y=f(x)的图象与x轴有交点</div>\n        <span class=\"arrow\">⟷</span>\n        <div class=\"bubble\">方程f(x)=0有实数根</div>\n      </div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p><strong>3. 幂函数</strong></p>\n\n<h3 class=\"subsection-title\">3.2 五个幂函数的图象</h3>\n\n<div class=\"graph-placeholder\">\n  [图象：五个幂函数 y=x, y=x², y=x³, y=x^(1/2), y=x^(-1) 的图象，坐标系中标注了各曲线]\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"subsection-title\">3.3 五个幂函数的性质</h3>\n\n<table class=\"prop-table\">\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>y=x</th>\n    <th>y=x²</th>\n    <th>y=x³</th>\n    <th>y=x<sup>1/2</sup></th>\n    <th>y=x<sup>-1</sup></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>定义域</td>\n    <td>R</td>\n    <td>R</td>\n    <td>R</td>\n    <td>[0,+∞)</td>\n    <td>(-∞,0)∪(0,+∞)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>值域</td>\n    <td>R</td>\n    <td>[0,+∞)</td>\n    <td>R</td>\n    <td>[0,+∞)</td>\n    <td>(-∞,0)∪(0,+∞)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>奇偶性</td>\n    <td>奇</td>\n    <td>偶</td>\n    <td>奇</td>\n    <td>非奇非偶</td>\n    <td>奇</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>单调性</td>\n    <td>增<br>x∈(-∞,+∞)</td>\n    <td>增<br>x∈[0,+∞)<br>减<br>x∈(-∞,0]</td>\n    <td>增<br>x∈(-∞,+∞)</td>\n    <td>增<br>x∈[0,+∞)</td>\n    <td>减<br>x∈(0,+∞)<br>减<br>x∈(-∞,0)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>公共点</td>\n    <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"center\">(1,1)</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
